{"strongs": "H0461", "word": "אֱלִיעֶ֫זֶר", "translit": "e.li.e.zer", "root": "אליעזר", "morph": "N:N-M-P", "pos": "proper name, masculine", "gloss": "prophet in time of Jehoshaphat", "definition": "אֱלִיעֶ֫זֶר ( עֶֿ֑זרֶ Gen 15:2 +) proper name, masculine ( God is help , compare Exod 18:4 see also אֶלְעָזָר below, עֲזַרְאֵל , Phoenician אשמנעזר , בעלעזר , עזרבעל ) \\ \\ a. Abraham's steward ( אֱלִיעֶ֑זֶר ), a Damascene Gen 15:2 . \\ \\ b. a son of Moses Exod 18:4 ; 1Chr 23:15 ; 1Chr 23:17 (twice in verse). \\ \\ c. Benjamite 1Chr 7:8 . \\ \\ d. several priests 1Chr 15:24 ; 1Chr 26:25 ; Ezek 10:18 . \\ \\ e. Reubenite 1Chr 27:16 . feminine prophet in time of Jehoshaphat 2Chr 20:37 . \\ \\ g. Levite chief Ezek 8:16 ; Ezek 10:23 . \\ \\ h. son of Harim Ezra 10:31 .", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB445')\">BDB445</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H461')\">H461</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB444')\">BDB444</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB446')\">BDB446</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>אֱלִיעֶ֫זֶר</bdbheb> (<bdbheb>עֶֿ֑זרֶ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Gen 15:2\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"15\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"15\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(1,15,2)\">Gen 15:2</ref> +) <b>proper name, masculine</b> (<highlight>God is help</highlight>, compare <ref ref=\"Exod 18:4\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"18\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"18\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(2,18,4)\">Exod 18:4</ref> see also  <bdbheb><reflink>אֶלְעָזָר</reflink></bdbheb> below, <bdbheb>עֲזַרְאֵל</bdbheb>, Phoenician <bdbheb>אשמנעזר</bdbheb>, <bdbheb>בעלעזר</bdbheb>, <bdbheb>עזרבעל</bdbheb>) <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>a.</b> Abraham's steward (<bdbheb>אֱלִיעֶ֑זֶר</bdbheb>), a Damascene <ref ref=\"Gen 15:2\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"15\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"15\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(1,15,2)\">Gen 15:2</ref>. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>b.</b> a son of Moses <ref ref=\"Exod 18:4\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"18\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"18\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(2,18,4)\">Exod 18:4</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Chr 23:15\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"23\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"23\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(13,23,15)\">1Chr 23:15</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Chr 23:17\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"23\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"23\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(13,23,17)\">1Chr 23:17</ref> (twice in verse). <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>c.</b> Benjamite <ref ref=\"1Chr 7:8\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(13,7,8)\">1Chr 7:8</ref>. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>d.</b> several priests <ref ref=\"1Chr 15:24\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"15\" vBegin=\"24\" cEnd=\"15\" vEnd=\"24\" onclick=\"bcv(13,15,24)\">1Chr 15:24</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Chr 26:25\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"26\" vBegin=\"25\" cEnd=\"26\" vEnd=\"25\" onclick=\"bcv(13,26,25)\">1Chr 26:25</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ezek 10:18\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(26,10,18)\">Ezek 10:18</ref>. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>e.</b> Reubenite <ref ref=\"1Chr 27:16\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"27\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"27\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(13,27,16)\">1Chr 27:16</ref>. <b>feminine</b> <highlightword>prophet in time of Jehoshaphat</highlightword> <ref ref=\"2Chr 20:37\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"20\" vBegin=\"37\" cEnd=\"20\" vEnd=\"37\" onclick=\"bcv(14,20,37)\">2Chr 20:37</ref>. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>g.</b> Levite chief <ref ref=\"Ezek 8:16\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(26,8,16)\">Ezek 8:16</ref>; <checkingNeeded/><ref ref=\"Ezek 10:23\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"23\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"23\" onclick=\"bcv(26,10,23)\">Ezek 10:23</ref>. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>h.</b> son of Harim <ref ref=\"Ezra 10:31\" b=\"15\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"31\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"31\" onclick=\"bcv(15,10,31)\">Ezra 10:31</ref>. </p><hr>", "references": [{"raw": "Gen 15:2", "book": "GEN", "chapter": 15, "verse": 2}, {"raw": "Exod 18:4", "book": "EXO", "chapter": 18, "verse": 4}, {"raw": "1Chr 23:15", "book": "1CH", "chapter": 23, "verse": 15}, {"raw": "1Chr 23:17", "book": "1CH", "chapter": 23, "verse": 17}, {"ra